    "describe_ch": "學習定點定理、收斂定理、泰勒展公式及數值分析在函數零根、內插多項式、微分、積分、微分方程等內容的相關應用理論。",
    "describe_eh": "Topics include fixed point theorem, convergence theorem and the applications on numerical analysis in zero roots of function, interpolation polynomial, differentiation, integration, differential equations, etc.",
